      ],
      "image": "assets/images/260825/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix egg yolks, 2 cups sugar, rum, and nutmeg together in a large mixing bowl. Cover with plastic wrap and refrigerate 8 hours to overnight to \"cure.\"",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ju5_c3DMXq9-bazOXiAGpr0---g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-260825-eggnog-spiked-with-rum-VAT-step-02-1coveredwithplastic-963f6fa5cc5c40f79b9a1e80ed11cea0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/260825/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat egg whites and remaining 1 cup sugar in a bowl using an electric mixer until firm peaks form.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DLyh1vf6-6zAoGCDoJ9xnWemNPg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-260825-eggnog-spiked-with-rum-VAT-step-03-3c6a203bbb9f47f1a490f61d5f5a3043.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/260825/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fold in heavy cream. Fold in the egg yolk mixture. Beat in half-and-half until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
