        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YCpNPm-1OBOzD3M_kpCOaL1VGcU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-260825-eggnog-spiked-with-rum-VAT-step-04-0d347178afb047ea9ae2a3ea4defda10.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/260825/step_04.webp"
